      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 10,
      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Return type change breaks both CLI callers",
      "description": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object instead of a stdout string and no longer throws. The callers in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 and packages/cli/src/status.ts:6 still call trim() and split() on the result. changedFiles throws a TypeError on every call, so the status command breaks. currentBranch catches its own TypeError and always returns null, even inside a repository. Update both callers in this change to check result.code and read result.stdout. currentBranch should return null when code is not zero.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "lens:return-shape-contract-break",
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object instead of a stdout string and no longer throws. The callers in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 and packages/cli/src/status.ts:6 still call trim() and split() on the result.",
      "consequence": "changedFiles throws a TypeError on every call, so the status command breaks. currentBranch catches its own TypeError and always returns null, even inside a repository.",
      "fix": "Update both callers in this change to check result.code and read result.stdout. currentBranch should return null when code is not zero."
    },
    {
