      "title": "Changed error behaviour has no covering test",
      "description": "safeGit now catches failures and returns an exit code instead of throwing. No test in the repository covers either path. Nothing would have caught the broken callers. Nothing will catch a later regression in the code mapping either. Add tests for safeGit success and failure results. Add tests for currentBranch and changedFiles against the new shape.",
